## 6. CERSAI Consent History

Every consent received from CRM is retained in the history table.

```sql
CREATE TABLE CKYCBULK.CERSAI_CONSENT_HISTORY
(
    CONSENT_HISTORY_ID      NUMBER
        GENERATED BY DEFAULT AS IDENTITY,

    CONSENT_ID              NUMBER NOT NULL,

    TRANSACTION_REFERENCE   VARCHAR2(100) NOT NULL,

    CIF_NUMBER              VARCHAR2(17) NOT NULL,

    SMS_REF_ID              VARCHAR2(100) NOT NULL,

    MOBILE_NUMBER           VARCHAR2(15) NOT NULL,

    CONSENT                 VARCHAR2(3) NOT NULL,

    CONSENT_TIMESTAMP       TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,

    AGENT_ID                VARCHAR2(50),

    REMARKS                 VARCHAR2(500),

    CREATED_DATE            TIMESTAMP
        DEFAULT SYSTIMESTAMP NOT NULL,

    CONSTRAINT PK_CERSAI_CONSENT_HISTORY
        PRIMARY KEY (CONSENT_HISTORY_ID),

    CONSTRAINT FK_CERSAI_CONSENT_HISTORY
        FOREIGN KEY (CONSENT_ID)
        REFERENCES CKYCBULK.CERSAI_CONSENT (CONSENT_ID),

    CONSTRAINT UK_CERSAI_CONSENT_TXN
        UNIQUE (TRANSACTION_REFERENCE),

    CONSTRAINT CK_CERSAI_CONSENT_HISTORY_VALUE
        CHECK (CONSENT IN ('YES', 'NO'))
);
```

Indexes:

```sql
CREATE INDEX IDX_CERSAI_CONSENT_HISTORY_CIF
