## 7. Creating a Consent Cycle

When a CERSAI download request is created and its SMS is delivered, create the consent state using the actual delivery timestamp from `SMS_TRANSACTION`.

```sql
INSERT INTO CKYCBULK.CERSAI_CONSENT
(
    CIF_NUMBER,
    SMS_REF_ID,
    CONSENT_STATUS,
    CONSENT_TAT_STATUS,
    CONSENT_TAT_EXPIRY_TIME
)
SELECT
    :cifNumber,
    s.SMS_REF_ID,
    NULL,
    'PENDING',
    s.DELIVERY_TIME + NUMTODSINTERVAL(3, 'DAY')
FROM SMS_TRANSACTION s
WHERE s.SMS_REF_ID = :smsRefId;
```

The corresponding download request starts with:

```text
CERSAI_DOWNLOAD_ELIGIBLE = P
```

