## 18. End-to-End Lifecycle

```text
SMS delivered
     |
     v
SMS_TRANSACTION.DELIVERY_TIME
     |
     v
CERSAI_BULK_DOWNLOAD_REQUEST
CERSAI_DOWNLOAD_ELIGIBLE = P
     |
     v
CERSAI_CONSENT
CONSENT_TAT_STATUS = PENDING
CONSENT_TAT_EXPIRY_TIME = DELIVERY_TIME + 3 days
     |
     +---------------------------+
     |                           |
     | CRM sends consent         | No consent
     | within TAT                | received
     |                           |
     v                           v
Consent API                 DB Scheduler
     |                           |
     v                           v
Record YES/NO              Stored Procedure
     |                           |
     v                           v
Consent TAT = RECEIVED     Consent TAT = EXPIRED
     |                           |
     v                           v
Download flag = N          Download flag = Y
                                 |
                                 v
                         CERSAI Download JAR
```

