## 19. Responsibility Matrix

| Component | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| SMS Callback Service | Capture actual SMS delivery time in `SMS_TRANSACTION` |
| CRM | Obtain customer consent and submit it to Consent API |
| EIS | Route CRM request to Consent API |
| Consent API | Validate and process received consent |
| `CERSAI_CONSENT` | Maintain current consent and TAT state |
| `CERSAI_CONSENT_HISTORY` | Maintain immutable consent history |
| Oracle Scheduler | Periodically invoke TAT expiry procedure |
| `PR_EXPIRE_CERSAI_CONSENTS` | Expire unanswered consent windows and mark download requests eligible |
| `CERSAI_BULK_DOWNLOAD_REQUEST` | Maintain download eligibility state |
| Download JAR | Pick records with `CERSAI_DOWNLOAD_ELIGIBLE = 'Y'` |

